---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Peterborough By The Numbers · ElectionFest"
  description="ElectionFest kiosk for Peterborough By The Numbers."
  canonical="https://vote.ajshearer.com/data/kiosk"
>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[#651024] px-6 py-10 text-white md:flex md:items-center">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#f0cbd5]">Peterborough By The Numbers</div>
        <h1 class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-5xl text-5xl font-black leading-[0.95] tracking-tight md:text-8xl">Pick something you want to know.</h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/75 md:text-2xl">Budget. Taxes. Council votes. Outcomes. Start with the data — then ask AJ what he thinks it means.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <a href="/data/budget" class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-7 text-[#3a1a22] shadow-xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 md:p-9"><div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#651024]">01</div><div class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black">Budget</div><p class="mt-3 leading-6 text-[#7a6167]">Where does the money go?</p></a>
        <a href="/data/votes" class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-7 text-[#3a1a22] shadow-xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 md:p-9"><div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#651024]">02</div><div class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black">Council Votes</div><p class="mt-3 leading-6 text-[#7a6167]">How did they vote?</p></a>
        <a href="/data/tax-drivers" class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-7 text-[#3a1a22] shadow-xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 md:p-9"><div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#651024]">03</div><div class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black">Tax Drivers</div><p class="mt-3 leading-6 text-[#7a6167]">What drove the increase?</p></a>
        <a href="/data" class="rounded-[2rem] border border-white/20 bg-white/10 p-7 text-white backdrop-blur md:p-9"><div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#f0cbd5]">04</div><div class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black">Outcomes</div><p class="mt-3 leading-6 text-white/70">What are we getting for it?</p><div class="mt-5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white/50">Coming next</div></a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-white/55">AJ Shearer · A Practical Voice for Monaghan Ward · vote.ajshearer.com</div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
